MiroFish upstream (https://github.com/QinJ-x/mirofish) is licensed under
AGPL-3.0. This directory keeps the two retained data-class contracts
(report_bridge.py, report_contracts.py), the manifest binding their bytes,
and this license file. The full upstream application snapshot was removed
from the repository as unused bulk; the provenance manifest and license
document the origin and rights for the retained, adapted code in
core/fusion/narrative.py (originally licensed AGPL-3.0 upstream, this copy
is under the project repository's distribution terms).
